.conf file that would make the occurrence of the race condition more difficult:\n\n1. Increase the GPO cache time out editing the following configuration directive in sssd.conf file:\n    a) ad_gpo_cache_timeout = 3600\n    Ps.: This value (3600) should make the cache time out in one hour but would make GPO updates propagation from AD server to local machines take longer.\n\n[1] https://access.redhat.com/documentation/pt-br/red_hat_enterprise_linux/7/html/windows_integration_guide/sssd-gpo"}],"x_generator":{"engine":"cvelib 1.8.0"},"x_redhatCweChain":"CWE-362: Concurrent Execution using Shared Resource with Improper Synchronization"}},"cveMetadata":{"assignerOrgId":"53f830b8-0a3f-465b-8143-3b8a9948e749","assignerShortName":"redhat","cveId":"CVE-2023-3758","datePublished":"2024-04-18T19:06:44.216Z","dateReserved":"2023-07-18T19:00:51.269Z","dateUpdated":"2026-11-07T11:32:43.281Z","state":"PUBLISHED"},"dataType":"CVE_RECORD","dataVersion":"5.2"}},
